# Names only. Copy to .env (never shared). SESSION_SECRET is set with `wrangler secret put` (live) or in .dev.vars (local); leave it empty here. APP_PASSWORD: only needed in .env for `npm run import -- --lyrics-ai` (same as the live password). APP_URL: your workers.dev address, also only for --lyrics-ai.
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
APP_PASSWORD=
SESSION_SECRET=
APP_URL=
